snp2.12:2.1 | S: “I ask the Teacher unrivaled in wisdom, | T: “We ask the Teacher of supreme discernment,
snp2.12:2.2 | S: who has cut off all doubts in this very life: | T: who has cut off uncertainty in the here-&-now:
