snp2.12:2.4 | S: who was well-known, famous, and quenched. | T: well-known, prestigious, with mind fully unbound.
snp2.12:3.1 | S: Nigrodhakappa was his name; | T: Nigrodha Kappa was his name,
snp2.12:3.2 | S: it was given to that brahmin by you, Blessed One. | T: given by you, Blessed One, to that brahman.
