snp2.12:11.3 | S: We raise our cupped palms one last time, | T: This last salutation is offered:
snp2.12:11.4 | S: one of unrivaled wisdom, <j>don’t deliberately confuse us. | T: Knowing, don’t delude us, one of discernment supreme.
snp2.12:12.1 | S: Knowing the teaching of the noble ones <j>from top to bottom, | T: Understanding the noble Dhamma from high to low, knowing,
