snp1.7:27.2 | S: that leads to the heavens; | T: (none)
snp1.7:27.3 | S: having discarded sensual desire, | T: dispassioned for sensual passion,
snp1.7:27.4 | S: he was reborn in a realm of divinity. | T: he reached the world of the Brahmās.
snp1.7:27.5 | S: His birth did not prevent him | T: His birth didn’t prevent him
snp1.7:27.6 | S: from rebirth in the realm of divinity. | T: from reaching the world of the Brahmās.
